icant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/131.0.6778.108/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"f1e477b49bab4aad33d18a63169b78e32db3001ac627b4d844404669dfc426c7"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/131.0.6778.108/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"4d2076b83f6d73b4e96864b72b898036a107ac46263c564ec832154e981fac0a"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/131.0.6778.108/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"897209a8dfa02a4097dfdd9e1271bf06174ee86dddcd01a6d071d7064183c8ef"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"131.0.6778.108"}